Reason: This check ensures that both `cmd->req.sg` and `cmd->iov` are initialized before `nvmet_tcp_build_pdu_iovec` is called. It covers all attack scenarios: uninitialized commands (both NULL), READ commands (only `cmd->req.sg` allocated, `cmd->iov` NULL), and WRITE commands (both allocated). The check prevents the NULL pointer dereference by rejecting the H2C_DATA PDU with an appropriate error.

